---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Building Now - Nivedita Pandey" description="A live view of what Nivedita Pandey is building - Dendrons.ai products, applied AI agents, and the problems she is actively pursuing.">
  <div class="building-page">
    <header class="page-header">
      <h1>Building Now</h1>
      <p class="page-description">
        A live view of what's in progress - problems I'm pursuing, products in use, and agents I've built for my own work.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Problems -->
    <section class="building-section">
      <h2 class="section-heading">Problems</h2>
      <p class="section-intro">The questions I keep returning to.</p>
      <ul class="problem-list">
        <li>Can a machine tell us something true about ourselves that conventional assessments miss?
          <span class="problem-pursuit">Pursuing it through MirrorMirror.life - personality assessment built on narrative psychology.</span></li>
        <li>If one person can work at the leverage of a team, what new responsibilities come with that power?
          <span class="problem-pursuit">Living it daily - Dendrons is built and run with the agents it ships.</span></li>
        <li>What does it take to reliably separate signal from noise when information is abundant and attention is scarce?
          <span class="problem-pursuit">Pursuing it through getHeard - media intelligence and stakeholder research.</span></li>
        <li>Why do businesses lose customers who have already raised their hand and shown interest?
          <span class="problem-pursuit">Pursuing it through getBookings + Newton - agents that turn intent into confirmed visits.</span></li>
        <li>What separates organisations that successfully operationalise AI from those that never get beyond pilots?
          <span class="problem-pursuit">Pursuing it through Compass assessments and 500+ officers trained across government and PSUs.</span></li>
        <li>How do you govern a resource that grows exponentially while remaining almost invisible?
          <span class="problem-pursuit">Pursuing it through Steward - token-level visibility and control of enterprise AI spend.</span></li>
        <li>When agents begin shopping on our behalf, what will the experience and trust look like?
          <span class="problem-pursuit">Pursuing it through the Agentic Commerce Suite - RankReady, TransactReady, TrustReady.</span></li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- Products -->
    <section class="building-section">
      <h2 class="section-heading">Products</h2>
      <p class="section-intro">Five suites. One platform. Built at <a href="https://dendrons.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Dendrons.ai</a>.</p>

      <div class="suite-list">

        <div class="suite-card">
          <div class="suite-card-top">
            <div>
              <span class="suite-label">Intelligence Suite</span>
              <h3 class="suite-name">getHeard</h3>
            </div>
            <span class="suite-status">Live</span>
          </div>
          <p class="suite-tagline">Know what's being said. Know what people actually think.</p>
          <p class="suite-description">Media intelligence and stakeholder research for government, public affairs, and research teams - from signal extraction to structured qualitative insight.</p>
          <div class="suite-products">
            <a href="https://getheardpulse.dendrons.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="suite-pill">Pulse</a>
            <a href="https://getheardvoice.dendrons.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="suite-pill">Voice</a>
          </div>
          <a class="suite-link" href="https://intelligence.dendrons.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Explore suite →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="suite-card">
          <div class="suite-card-top">
            <div>
              <span class="suite-label">Conversion Suite</span>
              <h3 class="suite-name">getBookings + Newton</h3>
            </div>
            <span class="suite-status">Live</span>
          </div>
          <p class="suite-tagline">Turn high-intent searches into confirmed visits.</p>
          <p class="suite-description">Two AI agents that close the gap between online interest and in-person commitment. getBookings hunts for high-intent visitors; Newton converts them into booked appointments.</p>
          <div class="suite-products">
            <a href="https://getbookings.dendrons.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="suite-pill">getBookings</a>
            <a href="https://newton.dendrons.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="suite-pill">Newton</a>
          </div>
          <a class="suite-link" href="https://conversion.dendrons.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Explore suite →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="suite-card">
          <div class="suite-card-top">
            <div>
              <span class="suite-label">Governance Suite</span>
              <h3 class="suite-name">Compass</h3>
            </div>
            <span class="suite-status">Live</span>
          </div>
          <p class="suite-tagline">AI ready. Data ready. Regulator ready.</p>
          <p class="suite-description">Four assessments for the full governance arc - from AI readiness strategy to continuous compliance monitoring.</p>
          <div class="suite-products">
            <a href="https://aiready.dendrons.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="suite-pill">AIReady</a>
            <a href="https://dataready.dendrons.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="suite-pill">DataReady</a>
            <a href="https://compass.dendrons.ai/governready" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="suite-pill">GovernReady</a>
            <a href="https://compass.dendrons.ai/stayready" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="suite-pill">StayReady</a>
          </div>
          <a class="suite-link" href="https://compass.dendrons.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Explore suite →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="suite-card suite-card--soon">
          <div class="suite-card-top">
            <div>
              <span class="suite-label">AI Operations</span>
              <h3 class="suite-name">Steward</h3>
            </div>
            <span class="suite-status suite-status--soon">Coming soon</span>
          </div>
          <p class="suite-tagline">Every token. Every dollar. Accounted for.</p>
          <p class="suite-description">Know what your AI is spending. Control it before the bill does. Rein governs AI spend at the enterprise level; Pare right-sizes model usage without sacrificing output quality.</p>
          <div class="suite-products">
            <span class="suite-pill suite-pill--muted">Rein</span>
            <span class="suite-pill suite-pill--muted">Pare</span>
          </div>
          <a class="suite-link" href="https://steward.dendrons.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Join waitlist →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="suite-card suite-card--soon">
          <div class="suite-card-top">
            <div>
              <span class="suite-label">Agentic Commerce</span>
              <h3 class="suite-name">Commerce Suite</h3>
            </div>
            <span class="suite-status suite-status--soon">Coming soon</span>
          </div>
          <p class="suite-tagline">Rank higher. Transact smarter. Stay secure.</p>
          <p class="suite-description">Be found in AI search, ready for agentic buyers, and trusted by regulators. Three products for businesses entering the agentic commerce era.</p>
          <div class="suite-products">
            <span class="suite-pill suite-pill--muted">RankReady</span>
            <span class="suite-pill suite-pill--muted">TransactReady</span>
            <span class="suite-pill suite-pill--muted">TrustReady</span>
          </div>
          <a class="suite-link" href="https://agenticcommerce.dendrons.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Learn more →</a>
        </div>

      </div>

      <div class="standalone-card">
        <div class="suite-card-top">
          <div>
            <span class="suite-label">Standalone</span>
            <h3 class="suite-name">MirrorMirror.life</h3>
          </div>
          <span class="suite-status">Live</span>
        </div>
        <p class="suite-description">Personality assessment built on narrative psychology. Tells you something true about yourself that standard tests miss.</p>
        <a class="suite-link" href="https://mirrormirror.life" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit →</a>
      </div>

      <!-- NitiScope findings card -->
      <div class="nitiscope-card">
        <div class="nitiscope-header">
          <div>
            <span class="nitiscope-tag">Procurement intelligence</span>
            <h2 class="nitiscope-title">NITI Scope</h2>
            <p class="nitiscope-sub">What does India's public-procurement record actually reveal?</p>
          </div>
          <span class="nitiscope-by">by Dendrons.ai</span>
        </div>
        <div class="nitiscope-findings">
          <div class="finding">
            <span class="finding-stat">1 in 8</span>
            <span class="finding-label">government awards drew only a single bidder</span>
          </div>
          <div class="finding">
            <span class="finding-stat">3x</span>
            <span class="finding-label">less competitive - central procurement vs. states</span>
          </div>
          <div class="finding">
            <span class="finding-stat">4.9M</span>
            <span class="finding-label">awards across India's entire procurement record, queryable</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a href="https://nitiscope.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="nitiscope-cta">Explore more at nitiscope.com →</a>
      </div>

    </section>

    <!-- Personal Agents -->
    <section class="building-section building-section--last">
      <h2 class="section-heading">Personal Agents</h2>
      <p class="section-intro">Tools built for my own workflows. They work. I use them daily. Not yet productized - but that may change.</p>
      <div class="agent-list">

        <div class="agent-item">
          <h3 class="agent-name">Verne <span class="agent-sub">built on NanoClaw</span></h3>
          <p class="agent-description">Personal AI assistant built on NanoClaw, an open-source framework I forked and extended. The customisation layer - memory management, WhatsApp and web interfaces, and my specific daily workflows - is what became Verne.</p>
          <p class="agent-inspiration">Named after Jules Verne - who imagined worlds that didn't exist yet, and wrote them into being anyway. It felt like the right name for a personal AI built from scratch.</p>
          <a class="agent-link" href="/verne/">Know more →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="agent-item">
          <h3 class="agent-name">Arsène</h3>
          <p class="agent-description">Task management agent. I forward emails to it and it builds and maintains a Kanban board of what needs doing. Keeps incoming chaos organised without manual triage.</p>
          <p class="agent-inspiration">Named after Arsène Lupin - the fictional gentleman who was always three steps ahead, never lost track of anything, and made it look effortless.</p>
          <a class="agent-link" href="https://arsene.niveditapandey.com/about" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Know more →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="agent-item">
          <h3 class="agent-name">Thoth AI</h3>
          <p class="agent-description">Form-filling agent. Handles repetitive documentation and application workflows.</p>
          <p class="agent-inspiration">Named after Thoth - the Egyptian god of writing, knowledge, and record-keeping. The divine scribe felt like the right name for an agent that exists to handle paperwork.</p>
          <a class="agent-link" href="https://thoth.dendrons.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Know more →</a>
        </div>

      </div>
      <p class="section-footer">
        These tools are built for my own work. If you are interested in the code, the approach, or exploring a productized version - <a href="/contact">get in touch</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .building-page {
    max-width: 750px;
  }

  .page-header {
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .page-header h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 4.5vw, 3.4rem); letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .page-description {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .building-section {
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
    padding-bottom: 4rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .building-section--last {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .section-heading {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .section-intro {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  /* Problems */
  .problem-list {
    list-style: disc;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .problem-list li {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .problem-pursuit {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    margin-top: 0.15rem;
  }

  /* Products - Suite Cards */
  .suite-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .suite-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    padding: 1.75rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .suite-card:first-child {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .suite-card--soon {
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .standalone-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .suite-card-top {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .suite-label {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
  }

  .suite-name {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .suite-status {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    white-space: nowrap;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    padding-top: 0.35rem;
  }

  .suite-status--soon {
    color: var(--accent);
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .suite-tagline {
    font-size: 0.925rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-style: italic;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .suite-description {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .suite-products {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
  }

  .suite-pill {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.65rem;
    border-radius: 20px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.35);
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 0.2s ease;
  }

  .suite-pill:hover {
    background: rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.1);
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .suite-pill--muted {
    border-color: var(--border);
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .suite-link {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
    align-self: flex-start;
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
  }

  .suite-link:hover {
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  /* NitiScope findings card */
  .nitiscope-card {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    padding: 1.75rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.2);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.04);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .nitiscope-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .nitiscope-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.65rem;
    border-radius: 20px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.35);
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .nitiscope-title {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin: 0 0 0.3rem;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .nitiscope-sub {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin: 0;
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .nitiscope-by {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    white-space: nowrap;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    padding-top: 0.2rem;
  }

  .nitiscope-findings {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.25rem;
    padding: 1.25rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.15);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.15);
  }

  .finding {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }

  .finding-stat {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--accent);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .finding-label {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .nitiscope-cta {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
    align-self: flex-start;
  }

  .nitiscope-cta:hover {
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .nitiscope-findings {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1rem;
    }
  }

  /* Personal Agents */
  .agent-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .agent-item {
    padding: 1.75rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .agent-item:first-child {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .agent-name {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .agent-sub {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-style: italic;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }

  .agent-description {
    font-size: 0.925rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .agent-inspiration {
    font-size: 0.825rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .agent-link {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
    align-self: flex-start;
  }

  .agent-link:hover {
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .section-footer {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    font-size: 0.925rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .section-footer a {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .section-footer a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .page-header h1 {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }

    .suite-name {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
